1
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,599
Xiao Kai...

2
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,879
How are things with Xinjie?

3
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,760
Don't worry about Xinjie.

4
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:50,840
I've already handled it.

5
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,760
Then when are you coming to see me?

6
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:58,640
I've been busy with work lately.

7
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,280
I don't have time to visit.

8
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,719
Always traveling for work.

9
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,439
You're always busy, busy, busy.

10
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,959
What kind of job is this anyway?

11
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:08,000
Hanging around all day

12
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,199
with shady characters.

13
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,719
Have you been fighting lately?

14
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,000
Are you hurt?

15
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,919
I'm not hurt.

16
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,319
Xiao Kai, I...

17
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,240
Don't mind your mom's nagging.

18
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:20,800
I'm getting old.

19
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,960
I just want you to stay safe and healthy.

20
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,680
Just don't let me be

21
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,879
a parent burying their child.

22
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,840
All right, I got it.

23
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:36,800
I'm hanging up now.

24
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,199
Ride-hailing real-name verification

25
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,039
requires the user's phone number,

26
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,280
ID, and bank card to belong to the same person.

27
00:04:03,439 --> 00:04:04,879
However, their verification system

28
00:04:05,039 --> 00:04:06,240
doesn't share data

29
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,280
with the police database.

30
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,159
So registering under someone else's identity

31
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,000
is entirely possible.

32
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:12,439
This user we found, Xiao Ran,

33
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:13,680
was actually registered dead

34
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,800
two months ago.

35
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,360
Criminals nowadays sell

36
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,360
complete sets of stolen personal data.

37
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,240
More and more people steal identities

38
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,319
to commit crimes.

39
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:27,319
Did you look into the phone

40
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,879
the suspect used to hail rides?

41
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,839
Call records from the telecom company show

42
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,160
that this phone number

43
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,399
has no other call history.

44
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,000
It was likely only used to hail rides.

45
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:38,160
But since yesterday,

46
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,399
the phone has been turned off.

47
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:42,480
The document in front of you

48
00:04:42,759 --> 00:04:43,680
shows the designated destinations

49
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,120
requested by this phone number

50
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,439
since it registered for the service.

51
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,279
If we check these locations,

52
00:04:49,639 --> 00:04:50,560
we can track down those

53
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,120
who bought drugs from the suspect.

54
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:53,319
Through these buyers,

55
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,839
we can find the seller.

56
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,560
I've already found the seller.

57
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:02,000
The rich kid we caught yesterday said

58
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,480
the seller reached out to him in a WeChat group.

59
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,759
I tried joining all the WeChat groups

60
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,759
that he was in.

61
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,720
To my surprise,

62
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,279
without me saying a single word,

63
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,759
the suspect added me directly.

64
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,360
"Misty Drizzle."

65
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,560
A woman?

66
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,480
Using a woman's photo doesn't make him one.

67
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,839
Is there any way to hook him?

68
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,240
I already did.

69
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,920
He's asking for my delivery address.

70
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:29,040
He said within two hours,

71
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,480
the goods will be delivered to the designated spot.

72
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,560
Delivered in just two hours?

73
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
That's pretty brazen.

74
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,439
Send it to Ding Tao.

75
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,199
Take a look.

76
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,560
Sent.

77
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:50,800
But the deliveries are made by ride-hailing drivers.

78
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,839
How do we catch the actual drug dealer?

79
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:53,920
There's a way.

80
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,360
Yesterday, the suspect handed off the drugs

81
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,040
to the driver on Wudao Street.

82
00:05:58,519 --> 00:06:00,120
We can contact the ride-hailing company

83
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,120
and have them cooperate with us.

84
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:03,360
During our agreed time window,

85
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,759
any driver who gets the order we set up

86
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,480
will be replaced by one of our officers

87
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,439
to meet the dealer.

88
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,959
However, we're not sure yet

89
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:13,079
if it's an individual or a syndicate.

90
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:14,920
So I think

91
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,920
we should split into at least two teams.

92
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,199
He Bo,

93
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,800
contact the ride-hailing company

94
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,040
and coordinate their cooperation.

95
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,079
Guan Qiang,

96
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,720
disguise yourself as a ride-hailing driver.

97
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,279
Li Xiao, pose as a passenger.

98
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:29,560
Contact the drug dealer

99
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,639
and set up a delivery time and location.

100
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:33,519
Try to schedule the delivery

101
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:35,319
between 2:00 and 4:00 p.m.

102
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,519
Got it.

103
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:37,720
Captain Lu,

104
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,519
get the mobile unit ready to make the arrest.

105
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:41,120
Understood.

106
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:41,959
Captain Bai,

107
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:44,000
then I'll have him deliver the goods before 4:00 p.m. today

108
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:45,920
to Hongyi Primary School on Jingzhou Road.

109
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,439
Sounds good.

110
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,160
Xiaokang usually

111
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,319
spends most of his time

112
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,000
fooling around with his girlfriend.

113
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,120
There's nothing suspicious about him.

114
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,600
Where were you yesterday?

115
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,199
The rehab center.

116
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,279
A friend of mine does drugs

117
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,879
and got sent there for rehab.

118
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,920
I went to check on him.

119
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:20,480
We have a mole among us,

120
00:07:20,639 --> 00:07:21,759
and you've got time for that?

121
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:24,480
I've tailed Xiaokang for days.

122
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,079
I really don't think he's dirty.

123
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,079
Were you on him 24 hours a day?

124
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:34,639
How can you be so sure he's clean?

125
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:37,959
We're all brothers here.

126
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:40,360
There's no need to be so suspicious.

127
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,720
It's not about whether it's necessary.

128
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,160
It's the rule in our line of work.

129
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,120
Caution matters more than loyalty.

130
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,680
Let me show you something.

131
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,959
Something felt off to me lately,

132
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,959
so I installed a camera here.

133
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,959
Look, this was recorded remotely on my phone.

134
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:21,839
Take a look.

135
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,759
This is that "brother" of yours.

136
00:08:27,639 --> 00:08:28,680
But just based on this,

137
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:30,360
we still cant be certain

138
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,839
that Xiaokang is an undercover cop.

139
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,159
It was found in my car.

140
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:54,679
Xiaokang did it.

141
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,279
What do you think?

142
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,759
Ever since that kid got out of prison,

143
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,840
I bet he turned into a police informant.

144
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,919
I kept wondering

145
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:09,519
why the cops have been tailing me lately.

146
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,120
So,

147
00:09:15,559 --> 00:09:16,759
what should we do now?

148
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,600
Xiaokang hasn't been with me long.

149
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:28,679
He couldn't have gotten much evidence on me.

150
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,320
Kai,

151
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:35,679
can you stage an accident for me?

152
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,159
Make it clean.

153
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,440
One more thing.

154
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:57,440
Grab a couple of guys

155
00:09:58,679 --> 00:10:00,159
and collect a debt for me at this place.

156
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,480
Remember to take Xiaokang along.

157
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,159
Don't let him catch on.

158
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,159
South Gate of No. 137.

159
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:28,039
Carpool to Hongfeng Garden Phase One.

160
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:31,840
The ride-hail plate is Nan AN10H1.

161
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,799
The driver's name is Cai Zhen.

162
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,720
Got it.

163
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:39,679
Captain Bai.

164
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:40,879
We checked this number.

165
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,559
Aside from regular ride-hailing,

166
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:44,120
there are no other call records.

167
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,519
It matches our suspect completely.

168
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:51,879
Track the car owner's phone.

169
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,000
Sync the car's location to Captain Lu.

170
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,000
The silver Accord

171
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,120
is just up ahead.

172
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,120
Let's catch up and cut them off.

173
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,039
Hey guys,

174
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:28,519
has Brother Biao's business gotten bigger lately?

175
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:29,519
He's collecting cash everywhere.

176
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,639
That's just chump change.

177
00:11:32,919 --> 00:11:33,720
Brother Biao said

178
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,440
he's going to squeeze Li Qiang for a huge score.

179
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:39,240
Then we should tell Brother Biao

180
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,919
to give us a raise.

181
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:42,799
In your dreams.

182
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,799
Brother Biao is too stingy.

183
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,759
He took us out for seafood the other day,

184
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,120
and wouldn't even order shark fin.

185
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,879
And you expect him to give us a raise?

186
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:52,440
Ge Dana,

187
00:11:53,399 --> 00:11:55,759
badmouthing Brother Biao behind his back?

188
00:11:56,519 --> 00:11:57,879
Brother Biao always rewards merit.

189
00:11:58,279 --> 00:11:59,679
As long as we do our jobs well,

190
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:00,840
money won't be a problem.

191
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,200
That's true.

192
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,440
Still, Brother Kai,

193
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:11,399
you're Brother Biao's favorite right now.

194
00:12:11,919 --> 00:12:14,159
If he gives you any assignments,

195
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,399
don't forget about us boys.

196
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,360
Whomever Brother Biao assigns,

197
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,639
he has his reasons.

198
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,720
If we're not meant to be involved,

199
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:23,720
we'd better stay out of it.

200
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,960
No way, we still have to ask Brother Biao

201
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,919
for a raise.

202
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:30,919
I want to buy a house and get married this year.

203
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,720
Wh-what's going on?

204
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:21,480
Who are you looking for?

205
00:13:22,399 --> 00:13:23,200
AC repair.

206
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:25,559
Isn't your AC broken?

207
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,120
Come on in.

208
00:13:49,919 --> 00:13:50,279
This way.

209
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:11,919
That guy in orange is him.

210
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:19,759
Are you the ride-share driver?

211
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,840
Did you book a ride to Hongfeng Estate?

212
00:14:23,799 --> 00:14:25,200
Yeah, yeah. Are you here?

213
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:25,840
I'm here.

214
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,559
I see you.

215
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:30,399
I'm heading over now.

216
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,200
I don't need a ride.

217
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,440
Could you deliver something for me?

218
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:51,080
Call the number on this when you get there.

219
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:51,799
Someone will pick it up.

220
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:52,960
Thanks.

221
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,120
Sure thing.

222
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:09,120
Move in!

223
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,200
Where are they?

224
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:14,960
In the back.

225
00:15:32,279 --> 00:15:33,120
Where's your hideout?

226
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,120
Right in that building.

227
00:15:35,559 --> 00:15:36,000
Upstairs.

228
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:37,840
How many of them?

229
00:15:38,679 --> 00:15:39,519
There were five at first.

230
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,200
Then three more came.

231
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:41,960
I don't know them.

232
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,039
Notify the detectives.

233
00:15:47,039 --> 00:15:47,679
Take us up.

234
00:15:48,279 --> 00:15:48,840
Okay.

235
00:15:58,639 --> 00:16:00,440
So you'll be collecting the money from now on?

236
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,879
I wouldn't know about that.

237
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,919
Where's that punk Hu Dong?

238
00:16:07,399 --> 00:16:07,960
He skipped town.

239
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,759
Who? Hu Dong?

240
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,759
Looks like you're just following orders, too.

241
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,759
All right, then.

242
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:41,600
Freeze!

243
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,120
Freeze! Don't move!

244
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:44,039
Don't move!

245
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:44,919
Stop!

246
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,840
Stop right there!

247
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:53,840
Come with me!

248
00:17:00,799 --> 00:17:01,360
Don't move!

249
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:14,119
Cuff him.

250
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:36,079
Split up!

251
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:48,559
Captain, look at this.

252
00:18:20,079 --> 00:18:21,240
Ding Tao, zoom in on image three.

253
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:21,559
Got it.

254
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,759
Xiao Cui, take your men and fall back right now!

255
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,480
Fall back!

256
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,279
I have a feeling that today,

257
00:19:47,799 --> 00:19:49,279
we're gonna die right here.

258
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:41,880
Screw you.

259
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,680
Shoot me.

260
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,279
Li Xiao, are you all right?

261
00:21:00,319 --> 00:21:00,920
I'll leave this to you.

262
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:01,279
All right.

263
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,440
I'll wait for you at the old house.

264
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,119
Put your hands up!

265
00:21:26,599 --> 00:21:27,640
This Li Xiao...

266
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:01,519
Stop!

267
00:22:06,519 --> 00:22:07,160
Drop your gun.

268
00:22:09,799 --> 00:22:10,680
What's the situation?

269
00:22:11,039 --> 00:22:12,000
I didn't want to blow my cover.

270
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,279
He was in danger just now.

271
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:14,799
You fired that shot.

272
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:23,359
Let me introduce you.

273
00:22:24,279 --> 00:22:26,079
Undercover officer, Wei Kai.

274
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:28,720
Li Xiao.

275
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:30,480
Wei Kai.

276
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:32,680
Li Xiao.

277
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,039
Nice moves.

278
00:22:34,319 --> 00:22:34,880
You too.

279
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:35,839
About earlier...

280
00:22:36,599 --> 00:22:37,119
Thanks.

281
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:48,119
Why didn't you give us a heads-up?

282
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:50,839
It happened so fast, there was no time.

283
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,759
Something's wrong with the tracker.

284
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,480
Did Liang Wenbiao find it?

285
00:22:56,039 --> 00:22:57,359
He's been getting more cautious lately.

286
00:23:01,799 --> 00:23:02,440
Are you compromised?

287
00:23:05,319 --> 00:23:05,960
I'm not sure.

288
00:23:10,559 --> 00:23:11,960
I won't know until I see Liang Wenbiao.

289
00:23:13,359 --> 00:23:14,640
If you can't be sure,

290
00:23:15,279 --> 00:23:16,559
I won't let you go back.

291
00:23:19,599 --> 00:23:22,119
Li Qiang contacted Liang Wenbiao again recently.

292
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:24,799
I think they'll make the deal in a few days.

293
00:23:25,319 --> 00:23:26,680
We've followed this lead for so long.

294
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,279
I don't want to give up now.

295
00:23:28,599 --> 00:23:29,680
Your safety comes first.

296
00:23:32,319 --> 00:23:34,279
Judging by the situation,

297
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:37,480
Liang Wenbiao probably suspects Chen Kang.

298
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,359
I should be safe for now.

299
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,400
I'll get off up ahead.

300
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:58,759
Hold on.

301
00:24:06,599 --> 00:24:07,200
A tracker.

302
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,160
Your birthday's in a few days.

303
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:15,079
This...

304
00:24:15,559 --> 00:24:16,519
This must be pretty expensive.

305
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,799
It didn't cost much.

306
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:19,079
Just play around with it.

307
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:24,200
Thanks, Boss.

308
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,359
Wei Kai.

309
00:24:28,359 --> 00:24:29,799
Remember what I told you.

310
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:31,920
Stay alive.

311
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:04,880
Let me make a call first.

312
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:14,319
What is it?

313
00:25:16,079 --> 00:25:17,160
The drugs from this trafficking ring

314
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,279
originated from the Chaoqing online store.

315
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,880
If our guess is right,

316
00:25:20,039 --> 00:25:21,960
Yike Gifts is tied to this as well.

317
00:25:22,799 --> 00:25:23,400
Got it.

318
00:25:24,759 --> 00:25:26,880
You've seemed a bit off lately.

319
00:25:27,039 --> 00:25:27,880
Why don't you take a few days off?

320
00:25:29,319 --> 00:25:30,480
I don't need to rest, Captain Bai.

321
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,359
But I'd like to request some time off.

322
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,799
Just half a day.

323
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:36,400
All right.

324
00:25:54,759 --> 00:25:55,440
Is Tian Xin here?

325
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:57,400
Tian Xin hasn't come in for two days.

326
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:02,200
If she shows up,

327
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,319
let me know right away.

328
00:26:04,079 --> 00:26:04,480
Okay.

329
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:05,480
Thanks.

330
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:06,559
You're welcome.

331
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:17,240
Tian Xin!

332
00:26:20,079 --> 00:26:20,759
Tian Xin!

333
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:26,960
Tian Xin!

334
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,759
Why didn't you just kill me?

335
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,559
Is that what you really think?

336
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,480
What are you really trying to do?

337
00:27:31,519 --> 00:27:32,720
Do you love him?

338
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:36,279
I asked if you love him!

339
00:27:39,279 --> 00:27:39,920
You won't answer?

340
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,920
Then I'll take my men to ask your boyfriend.

341
00:27:44,559 --> 00:27:46,240
What the hell do you want?

342
00:27:46,279 --> 00:27:47,839
I asked if you love him!

343
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:48,400
Yes!

344
00:27:53,279 --> 00:27:53,880
I love him.

345
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,680
I... Yes, I love him!

346
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:08,319
Then you'd better pray.

347
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,440
Maybe I'll grant your wish.

348
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,359
No!

349
00:28:23,519 --> 00:28:24,640
Don't!

350
00:28:26,519 --> 00:28:27,480
Come back!

351
00:28:27,799 --> 00:28:28,759
No!

352
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,440
Please don't!

353
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,559
I only sent you to pick up cash,

354
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:38,640
and you caused such a huge mess!

355
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:39,839
Brother Biao...

356
00:28:40,519 --> 00:28:41,720
This had nothing to do with us.

357
00:28:42,759 --> 00:28:44,079
The cops were going after that kid, Zhao Jianfeng,

358
00:28:44,279 --> 00:28:45,279
and we just happened to run into them!

359
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:47,599
If it weren't for Brother Kai today,

360
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,119
the two of us would've gone down too.

361
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,599
You two made it back,

362
00:28:52,279 --> 00:28:52,960
but where's Kai?

363
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,880
If the cops caught him,

364
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:56,200
we'd all be completely exposed!

365
00:28:58,279 --> 00:28:58,799
Brother Kai!

366
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:03,480
Brother Biao.

367
00:29:05,119 --> 00:29:05,759
Are you all right?

368
00:29:05,799 --> 00:29:07,279
I almost didn't make it out.

369
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,720
Where's Xiaokang? He didn't come back?

370
00:29:10,519 --> 00:29:11,799
Like he'd dare come back!

371
00:29:12,119 --> 00:29:13,519
If I get my hands on that bastard,

372
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:15,160
I swear I'll kill him!

373
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:18,319
I knew something was off with him.

374
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:22,240
You two go track him down right now.

375
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:23,559
Go, right now!

376
00:29:24,599 --> 00:29:25,079
Right away, Boss.

377
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:32,240
As for what I told you to do,

378
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:34,119
get on it immediately.

379
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,799
Miss Gu, what advice do you have for me?

380
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:52,480
Between Weiyuan International Trade and your Runze Commerce,

381
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:53,839
there have been massive financial transactions,

382
00:29:54,079 --> 00:29:55,759
but the transaction details in these account books

383
00:29:55,839 --> 00:29:57,039
make no sense at all.

384
00:29:59,200 --> 00:29:59,720
Miss Gu,

385
00:30:00,759 --> 00:30:02,319
I don't follow what you're saying.

386
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:03,920
Runze Commerce

387
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:06,079
is a subsidiary of Longze Group.

388
00:30:06,599 --> 00:30:08,279
How did it become my personal company?

389
00:30:10,839 --> 00:30:12,160
In Runze Commerce, you hold

390
00:30:12,279 --> 00:30:13,519
a 70 percent stake.

391
00:30:14,279 --> 00:30:16,599
Longze Group holds 30 percent on paper,

392
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,880
but when it comes to Runze Commerce's profits,

393
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:20,480
the group has never actually shared in them.

394
00:30:21,079 --> 00:30:22,000
Especially over the past two years,

395
00:30:22,359 --> 00:30:23,720
it hasn't received any dividends.

396
00:30:24,599 --> 00:30:26,039
I really can't understand

397
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,640
why all those payments from Runze Commerce

398
00:30:27,839 --> 00:30:29,839
to Weiyuan International

399
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:31,240
had to be routed through so many

400
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,640
of Longze Group's subsidiaries.

401
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:36,960
I've been with Longze Group for so many years,

402
00:30:38,039 --> 00:30:39,440
and the board of directors has never once

403
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,559
questioned my accounts.

404
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,839
If there's anything you're unclear about,

405
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:47,640
you can ask President Jiang directly.

406
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:50,039
President Jiang was the one who sent me to ask you.

407
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,519
Miss Gu,

408
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:56,559
I know you returned from abroad.

409
00:30:57,279 --> 00:30:58,400
You might think

410
00:30:58,680 --> 00:31:00,759
things here work just like in Europe.

411
00:31:01,759 --> 00:31:03,039
Since you're new here,

412
00:31:03,359 --> 00:31:04,160
even though you're targeting me,

413
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:05,440
I won't hold it against you.

414
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:06,880
But let me remind you,

415
00:31:07,759 --> 00:31:09,279
when you arrive at a new place,

416
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:12,839
you'd better adapt to your new surroundings first.

417
00:31:14,279 --> 00:31:15,279
In this company,

418
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:18,480
every department has its own rules

419
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:19,319
and unspoken rules.

420
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:22,559
Before you understand the rules,

421
00:31:23,359 --> 00:31:24,920
you'd better not act so recklessly.

422
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:28,400
I don't really follow what you're saying.

423
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:31,519
The company hired me to do my job.

424
00:31:31,799 --> 00:31:33,000
I'm not targeting anyone.

425
00:31:34,039 --> 00:31:35,559
But whatever the company assigns me,

426
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,720
I will make sure it's done right.

427
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,440
If anyone's actions

428
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:40,640
harm this company,

429
00:31:42,319 --> 00:31:43,720
I will investigate to the very end.

430
00:31:43,880 --> 00:31:44,960
Then take your time investigating.

431
00:31:57,920 --> 00:31:59,079
But let me warn you,

432
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,440
in whatever you do,

433
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,559
always leave yourself a way out.

434
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,920
Don't act rashly and hit a brick wall,

435
00:32:05,559 --> 00:32:06,759
where there's no turning back

436
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,440
and you end up crushed to pieces.

437
00:32:27,519 --> 00:32:28,759
Things have been too hot lately,

438
00:32:29,359 --> 00:32:31,240
so I didn't get you involved in much.

439
00:32:32,559 --> 00:32:34,640
But our situation is getting worse.

440
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,880
The boss stopped us from collecting debts recently.

441
00:32:40,359 --> 00:32:41,960
Does he not trust us anymore?

442
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,200
It's not that simple.

443
00:32:43,759 --> 00:32:45,039
Four-Legged Snake showing up

444
00:32:46,079 --> 00:32:48,400
seems to be about more than just replacing Mr. Ma.

445
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,200
Didn't they say everything would be fine once Qian Feng was handled?

446
00:32:53,119 --> 00:32:54,480
That was the plan.

447
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,079
But who would've thought

448
00:32:56,079 --> 00:32:57,759
the guys that idiot Four-Legged Snake sent

449
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,599
would all get busted by the police?

450
00:33:00,559 --> 00:33:03,279
Qian Feng might've already told the police everything.

451
00:33:04,759 --> 00:33:06,880
The police have never come to check on Longze Group.

452
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:09,599
Could you be overthinking this, Mr. Chen?

453
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:12,640
I hope so.

454
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:14,759
There's just too much going on lately.

455
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:17,160
Qian Feng got arrested,

456
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,720
and a new CFO was transferred to the company.

457
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,559
Even Mr. Jiang can't handle her.

458
00:33:24,319 --> 00:33:25,960
We have so much money

459
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:28,319
that used to be laundered through Longze Group.

460
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,480
If Gu Xiaoyi keeps digging like this,

461
00:33:32,119 --> 00:33:33,680
I'm afraid what we did

462
00:33:34,279 --> 00:33:35,680
won't stay hidden for long.

463
00:33:36,319 --> 00:33:38,400
I don't quite get what you mean, Mr. Chen.

464
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,720
Do you want me to

465
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:43,759
make this Gu Xiaoyi disappear?

466
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:49,079
Not just yet.

467
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:53,079
Though I think it's time to give her a warning.

468
00:33:53,319 --> 00:33:54,000
Understood.

469
00:34:00,839 --> 00:34:03,519
It hasn't rained in Nanhai for a long time.

470
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:08,320
When I was a kid, my grandma used to tell me

471
00:34:08,840 --> 00:34:10,840
that if it hasn't rained for a long time,

472
00:34:12,639 --> 00:34:14,559
you must remember to bring an umbrella when going out.

473
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,880
When Mr. Ma left,

474
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:25,280
he said he'd be back in a while.

475
00:34:25,599 --> 00:34:27,800
Why haven't we heard anything from him yet?

476
00:34:29,079 --> 00:34:29,960
He won't be coming back.

477
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:35,159
I don't think anyone can save him now.

478
00:34:52,079 --> 00:34:52,639
Let's go.

479
00:35:10,199 --> 00:35:11,559
Wasn't it supposed to be tomorrow?

480
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:13,559
Why make a move today all of a sudden?

481
00:35:14,440 --> 00:35:16,719
Word is the cops have an operation tomorrow.

482
00:35:16,719 --> 00:35:18,679
I suspect our cover's blown.

483
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:43,239
Wait here.

484
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:16,880
Cheers.

485
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:25,239
Hurry up! Pack it up quickly.

486
00:36:25,239 --> 00:36:25,800
Got it.

487
00:36:33,199 --> 00:36:33,679
Who's there?

488
00:36:42,239 --> 00:36:43,639
We're here to pick up the goods for Mr. Chen.

489
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:45,840
Weren't you supposed to pick it up this afternoon?

490
00:36:46,559 --> 00:36:48,039
Mr. Chen needs to ship the goods right away.

491
00:36:48,039 --> 00:36:49,800
So please cooperate with us.

492
00:36:50,639 --> 00:36:51,159
Abu.

493
00:36:58,079 --> 00:36:59,679
Are you really Mr. Chen's men?

494
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:02,039
How come I've never seen you before?

495
00:37:45,159 --> 00:37:47,159
Tony, I missed you.

496
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:48,519
I missed you too.

497
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:50,320
Where's my money?

498
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:53,360
Money, money... Where's my money?

499
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,239
Money, money, money. Fine, money.

500
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,800
Money, money.

501
00:37:59,119 --> 00:37:59,840
Money.

502
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:03,239
Money.

503
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:05,639
Where is my money?

504
00:38:06,599 --> 00:38:07,360
Money.

505
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,119
Scram right now,

506
00:38:11,519 --> 00:38:12,360
and you might make it out alive.

507
00:39:34,079 --> 00:39:34,519
Zhuang!

508
00:39:36,199 --> 00:39:36,840
Zhuang!

509
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:41,079
Zhuang!

510
00:39:45,079 --> 00:39:45,920
Zhuang, where are you?

511
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:49,280
Zhuang!

512
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:03,800
Let's go.

513
00:40:07,559 --> 00:40:08,000
Zhuang,

514
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:09,519
are you okay?

515
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,400
Police! The police are here!

516
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:34,119
Police!

517
00:40:49,639 --> 00:40:50,400
Excuse me, everyone.

518
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:51,519
We got a tip.

519
00:40:51,599 --> 00:40:53,119
They moved their operation up to today.

520
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:53,920
Today?

521
00:40:54,079 --> 00:40:54,360
Yes.

522
00:40:54,559 --> 00:40:56,159
But we're not ready yet.

523
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:58,719
Moving today is too dangerous.

524
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,039
It's sudden,

525
00:41:00,039 --> 00:41:01,400
so please activate the backup plan right away.

526
00:41:01,400 --> 00:41:02,199
Please help us.

527
00:41:02,199 --> 00:41:02,719
Chief!

528
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:10,679
A shootout broke out at No. 39 Zhouliu Pedestrian Street.

529
00:41:10,679 --> 00:41:13,679
Nearby patrols are heading there now.

530
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:17,280
Let's go.

531
00:41:21,199 --> 00:41:22,079
Move, now!

532
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:34,440
Let's go.

533
00:41:48,239 --> 00:41:48,559
Tony!

534
00:41:49,599 --> 00:41:49,920
Come back!

535
00:41:50,159 --> 00:41:50,800
Go!

536
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:51,320
Come back!

537
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:17,239
Thirty-five minutes ago,

538
00:42:17,239 --> 00:42:19,320
at No. 39 Zhouliu Pedestrian Street,

539
00:42:19,320 --> 00:42:21,599
a shooting occurred.

540
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:23,920
Police neutralized several suspects at the scene.

541
00:42:24,079 --> 00:42:27,320
We still don't know the situation inside,

542
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:29,639
but reportedly, inside the warehouse,

543
00:42:29,639 --> 00:42:32,119
there are still two gunmen.

544
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:35,039
The commanding officer at the scene declared

545
00:42:35,159 --> 00:42:37,280
that if the suspects resist,

546
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:40,000
they will be shot on sight.

547
00:42:48,039 --> 00:42:50,119
Into the room where the shooting occurred,

548
00:42:50,119 --> 00:42:52,320
police have just deployed tear gas.

549
00:43:08,039 --> 00:43:10,760
We can see over a dozen police officers

550
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:13,159
storming inside armed with heavy weapons.

551
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:15,199
We believe these criminals

552
00:43:15,199 --> 00:43:16,920
will surely all be rounded up.
